  "title": "FB Financial Corporation Reports First Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "Reports Q1 Diluted EPS of $1.10, Adjusted Diluted EPS* of $1.12 FB Financial Corporation (the “Company”) (NYSE: FBK), parent company of FirstBank, reported net income of $57.5 million, or $1.10 per diluted common share, for the first quarter of 2026, compared to $1.07 in the previous quarter and $0.84 in the first quarter of last year. Adjusted net income* was $58.3 million, or $1.12 per diluted common share, compared to $1.16 in the previous quarter and $0.85 in the first quarter of last year.",
